          "sec_id": 179853705420671994669433498324216394005,
          "title": "Diffusion Models",
          "raw_text": "Diffusion models achieve state-of-the-art performance in image and video generation. They gradually denoise random noise into structured data. While producing high-quality outputs, inference can be slow. Examples include Stable Diffusion , Imagen , DALL-E 2 and Mid- journey .",
