      "title": "Key Comparisons",
      "raw_text": "Feature Transformers Diffusion DeepONet FNO\nBest Use Text / Code Images / Video Physics Theory Fluid Dynamics Speed Medium Slow Medium Very Fast Mathematical Basis Attention Stochastic Universal Approximation Fourier Space Input Type Sequences Pixels Functions Grids / Meshes",
      "page_start": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
